  "title": "Stroganoff",
  "description": "Wondering how to make beef stroganoff? Here&#39;s a simple, inexpensive version of this popular dinner entrée. Sautéed ground beef and onions are combined with cream of mushroom soup and sour cream, then served over egg noodles.",
  "authors": [
